      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK.\r\n成功get了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f5576053b450106745d050623d236728b6d1c1e2834674f61a0d97229266d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcb5848657ae1a1410a682d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66cff3c7d043017a5519659d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "626ba48f2e38a2cc019590d7925bf444771a426356237ab425beb0f36f8d2852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ce4052ac510a1eb0521dea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758a23ba3b4ff252a4e5eac29e32085c8aaa84f0e672e96ad91d5390fb0aa06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb7729fa50db48a51acf582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba16fd47f267409b4aae384b25b779f53e37d9c9b73617f995ac608cac2f371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6bc0fc226d6954816c98556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e2d53b9afc302fe6193a0f0c17c886a3d13d1fd0a390efb052c4a77ba94a09d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3125633afdd137e41f2e1345",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8a3096875a7dc77cda646ff87c9c22eca06f70f59a036288e698b17b9b7c1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6b9751bfefebe09c68452f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oops……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3adf9ef2483d00a4b0546510260560d63ab8ea5811d379b9ce005abd373232e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f68645373267bd9e2759ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0e489c2deafb3324a47d6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b931cbbc5ff834d619d16792036706cc06f14cf1a2024230235d3263006af89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f153e94d5d3999056e7c57d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8433a2328b9a403b79fda74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "掉下去了啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01557f168b32d27d3826f68dd91ee22129ec0563b73774fb95e81007e747a168",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eabc0f28fafdc830cfd6e3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天的是……这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd5ef4b9daa15dc4caedfe1c8f21257d330e9bf91d92dd93f373af008b7b1c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e54cc3e1e46bba5d37d02a99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体力──低落。集中力──减少。\r\n──我提议休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd4274e3d1afc485925eaa0adb3026f98271cdf64f53cbfda3720a96eb92c3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9f93cdc3358313030be823a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然不是──不能做……\r\n但并非──best……",
      "source_fingerprint": "064ab783d58474bece9d1d1261289e86b25283f00bd9e18ad6c56579839c3455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:210d351895d0a34bb158057c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "All right.\r\n感觉──充满了力量。\r\n──请下指令。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb0917e9c803dd2f6815424f34bf64e0499ad2e7319799955a9ecc6e976b842",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c1c02de4dd881b9618ae13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态──excellent。\r\n一切──万无一失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b8e91905b531b260573378ecc7c986da0e3321f5d0c983091046d950d54e7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4607c19e2bd636b1b0e7037f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身──做完了。\r\nAll right……开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd72937264fef01b44c51e0d385f7019906ca3850f42e6d79c5bf9c73f6f509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818c367f10fff15b64e678c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会带动日本的竞赛界。\r\n为了报达恩情──我会变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "222b169857810d0434834cd4da79baa828d5116cfd0e59e9e4b0486b56685415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264f12f0d634684c4ad8609e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练──开始吧。\r\n为了──达成使命──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1bf4164b7357922e1e94361e21cf2445d3726e4d8d56b5f590a628dc36a4ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e866b9a697031a52c64d0c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "持之以恒──会成为实力。\r\n没有快捷方式──只能靠累积。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38abff0ec851af3b66e981886eb9945069c31394647812f0e1bf525a66f6fe39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3220943a6ee98e5e547681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体……好沉重……但no problem.\r\n──我会完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8484b43bbc62578b1f1bef8896a743f0b042a00f03dcee623ffe00eb8deffb87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf5637e787b3be9c1f1e0a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼………………\r\n──不──不需要担心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "97edb7a6c8b086f83e3ddc465a9229529617a2c4a37877522ed463e1e9bf700e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b94190014c2594508c245b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Sorry.\r\n注意力涣散了……\r\n我立刻──调整。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9baa6208ab0ae8e66dabe54daab4e7996613a84a09376e139b66f9e85f9dcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb6dc784718de76caf9fd04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……这样下去──\r\n如何报答恩情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab2fd76c504462b0820507d176a27607bc247b1d4b104ee2e4654032b74420c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b7330343c762c3e68a2d26a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竞赛接二连三啊。\r\n最好把风险──也加入考虑比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "538cb0dd23e5270a3617f8d457423fc4aedc2274c72b3e70eedc6e389841c207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b948c5a20464be1d50fe1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在出场──并非上策。\r\n爱护身体──也是为了使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f06182f9bef919cd8863036f7189f800c86a0e3c8481b1c6f50a6ce9cc909e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:617c5c9079b3d50497b91eef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I'm in perfect form.\r\n完美无缺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b20de8f1e53f2008cd9375c3d9454b270e83159cf1d72e36887474d137f64dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9984befd329943e313fdd840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜算──很高。\r\n只要──照着作战跑就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68a8fb8328360002e859fd29762858dbec629702849bd5cb900001140f163e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adde7b4ed3905cbbf4827d2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I will do it.\r\n我一定要──报恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2eccc3bb0cdeb2f6c5a31a9650545eefc387a4621c48bea26c6b85c4d50224f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:556553b7fc3a2a11a60e3e96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes──状态很好。\r\n再来只需──竭尽全力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa34c0619b2e7c8492810c9614cf7bb1c5aa20146b5708574402b94ac7673f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1775ad2d069e5ab565079fa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会达成mission──\r\n目标只有──胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3d3239f5410b059bb41ff8c547d6208b9d39888f39df49f8d8347e8c7e63c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f633ee3a0da87d4662f3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定──会靠这种跑法，\r\n掀起革命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc207539e107ef83cba7f7a40585ebfb53e9ae234abe72dc390cff2155802921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:792ba085e2f31f86a4a61059",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿出成果──\r\n那就是报恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccf25cf3aee76fa6d7b624f5ac1226011db6a52455a3a6b78cc8630ea7269ae0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d73761a32dba6dd8f68614",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备──已经做好了。\r\n随时都能──上场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "415f717c7a506ff3c03ea161d137ddacba3a737eb6dab03721ed1ae95ec183c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:423c1749c79afdbfb2b92114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要像以往一样──达成使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44662d6f24d6955ee9c52c18eed4809306fc5400b6e871b1cb4a9cc7f05c323a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d6633fb62b38149e4226ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然称不上──绝佳状态……\r\n但结果最重要。我会做到的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "076575b914c9aa238ba0c1cb94c4100b211c4a5a69cb4677db5df28dc65dc4a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b89ead69868a941b4093bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是怎样的状况──\r\n训练──都不会白费……",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf631c395adb94d1a7654cf66c55ad79ff8fcb81f212dd30d9d73db1be928e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46b79f466e26868d60a64b7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因应──突发状况。\r\n也是一种报恩方式吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78884baa2ef9d87ee9ed393769ec1c2e33726450f46de87dca820edbaa27e06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30fc2508ba2a1393415e5c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然──集中力被打乱了……\r\n还是要全力以赴……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93bde9f7da5c8560942f40ff4a92222e91a2b749f1d34480fa7bb63c4bdf422e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bc52af48df3feff9a8a396a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…………\r\n不能有──拙劣的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fe4e943e202052392a6d87ba16ca9a0da82a8f492c517da4f260f30436dd4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ec2bdb3e06cbd354fba1c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使胜算不大──\r\n报答恩情仍然是我的使命……",
      "source_fingerprint": "25b528048340c90d6f61132c55dd0650fced4814d7a9482c6e2434aa27419fed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca3329b8f181f02713e2b82f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Go──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37f63467f5d0886039db5a6c67f2af2b9c8031661e7e5f6bdf7bf5905435a63f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e35b1c9e1da650342c1d0328",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Alright.",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa6bb507275539764d28626ec38495b292f2c405017ac0dc77e3a1336c41355a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf9d482195cc60a23f0b8251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0918f2653d46f7850e910a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK.",
      "source_fingerprint": "b814aabdde112d89d45105c3205482949a86d7bbc33040034db21f7a85c84c4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce318c169a10d94f5fe2425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89281cfe4dc0957422bef999",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oops──",
      "source_fingerprint": "416bfbcc729b9c49859b1ade7d5caccb6d002b8ef907e322a3c136e7396d81f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8247c629702fa017635be38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc23146efaa5b9bd82b5ca6bacba270ace6a87e0a701ce2e285077510313307c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e4a3161a05ea6d3f785950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2be64082bad991d011836ee64517ab10bc3f512df0899a6f0b2f9b27c9a98786",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109398df3c09e07ae42476fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thanks.\r\n受你照顾了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "657b10f644d21840553beb301e486c780112ccacf81caf0a71b5637e170bd671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82e9c9a77f25c871d14cca98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK──这段日子还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cc2bd6d4f02652ff2fc28fe722973f94720fbff6c9aae551f0ebd1d1e2fde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4211658e449588382cb279a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始共同训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c5fde3ea594ee2a3c0c90c3e61a233517565b5661c40c35e61644484ba8bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44d79de94d5c42984dd1b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76fedf1b165c197423903e335bad6eee1303026378c06ead8e3ea69b05677655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6908741b2750f7c3b10dafba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Leave it to me.",
      "source_fingerprint": "2787e327622e4cf1fdb8f8cf325ca0eec942580feba87fae2fa0539682b1c2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c373c924c8fc72cd50dcfcd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK──这段日子还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cc2bd6d4f02652ff2fc28fe722973f94720fbff6c9aae551f0ebd1d1e2fde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09f515287a2ed705f3bb0b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我必定──会靠这种跑法，\r\n掀起革命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc207539e107ef83cba7f7a40585ebfb53e9ae234abe72dc390cff2155802921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f10f824c064b50292ba25a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I will do it.\r\n我一定要──报恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2eccc3bb0cdeb2f6c5a31a9650545eefc387a4621c48bea26c6b85c4d50224f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3084e79829a6943e725ff84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "OK──这段日子还不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cc2bd6d4f02652ff2fc28fe722973f94720fbff6c9aae551f0ebd1d1e2fde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:533940a08e8dc240af106175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始める。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10a099082fcbf6eb771305679a6890b8feaa9831dc6d24949eb11081d4e5a42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bec795bebe517dcf1bcf5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Not too bad……就差一步──",
      "source_fingerprint": "7068716fcd7d6dfe82915ce2e990c2ad3c6ad2306a15315d6c5f64972a223909",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced3031c4177ea5e32fa4b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Darn it.\r\n下一场──我会雪耻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd5397e477c81133fffbc1a8876f21b907e26d62393ba2f7938bb947408c4013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5785277731774551ed3cf3c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔──得重新……审视训练才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d3466a6eaeac57508f1943b7d32b9a89c2c4a2180681e35f419bea1bcebe78d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cdc5b4ffb581e54ced51e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务──失败……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ece131c8b91737862281a4e0e0740a908b4bdd2fa43809ab1e21721695e618e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32ab0861fc93c8b1ee8c0d5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission Accomplished.\r\n以后也要报答恩义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f003d52bfb9459a9f7cf6ec89061fb5b2540ff730bdafeb36a14e49fcd2f841",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38ce76e7008dbf82b1f9819",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已完成了职责。\r\n往下个任务──迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01fa802177eb933bb9084a613cf6c102742fec2cc34bb284ea2cc17fbdc18e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8993a8ff2a1bb6086f5913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放熱開始――少々――熱くなりすぎたか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "199e200f3320e21d3a13115783bc537435e92b1ead7953446baeea93e4bc0f89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4383450aa8a3721d55d8bbf0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "責務は果たした。\r\n次のミッションへ――向かう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "801aff4a5e9987316199f65dc580426bbf74114e26107a4cec5bc8106b546378",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a385622813152341eaa1e73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:734c0fea46ea612bd38ec166",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就是现在──一定要拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2074f6188cae4b71ea0181d4e1a526877a9d611bfa373dca19b54ac3dbae593f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91517f56f01f15a081462355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近――後輩たちから――\r\n呼ばれる、nickname――軍曹。\r\n…名に恥じぬ――指導を、しよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03c4ff73b52a0aba875555def468e74ae4c2a485927f93f4daf5bf7caaa8f8d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83c170a0721dcdc46f99976",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…緊張、している。\r\nだが…不思議だ。\r\nもっと…演じたい、とは。",
      "source_fingerprint": "095931e6ab51086a1664dc85c864dc6f07a9b3c60aabdb81cb2bf60ae73d0641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a617318cfc95256b1f1155f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会赢──为了使命……\r\nTarget in sight──呼──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cd15570233caaed363f1e2ff55c5e7b9dea8b57e032f313d5a628c7adb34235",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cd1d30b48d5a3eeaf577f73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――Oklahoma Mixer.\r\n…クラスメイトが、踊ろうと。\r\n…行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "537d6e2c491614081f6fe480ae74e1080559eaa65a6fd02d84509e7419854e5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4084b0b7127721aa0f30488e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Event Missions――\r\n速やかに――遂行する。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d8cc14181bb111cc6f064f4667953e3decdf322e2735a44a2fee2ccdfb6431",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f47e30105df0639177d2db1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Mission Accomplished.\r\n報酬を――得た。\r\n――受け取れ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d5b5f17e32bf9437239f8427f0575aca8bda78552f598e12b4e561dcaea9aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66b2490052f95f95ad0e0951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Unforgettable memories.\r\n――……この胸に。\r\n使命へ、戻ろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ad66bc62ca46a7ca3712ade9d011848ed0bdd86eee22acfe508c5ffc2cc9ed4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1642d83497988c35c0cf19f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "守り通すのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c92c9a123ba54fcb093d7079c1224b2bbc60f16978135ccd8eeee875b009591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91aae4ee23ce1af9797a145",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "何人が、立ち入ろうと――システム制限解除。\r\n出力全開――我が信念、守り通すのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd4f5c184ee7a5e0b6ca18ed94bd9008ee3c9f09fdf52b3e02f94329bbe5457c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1083",
        "40004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
